64247285-0306260716161616.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Bedroom in 3.5 BHK Apartment at Audumber Shree Krishna CHS Borivali, Borivali East – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639161109766929186-0306260716161616.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Bathroom in 3.5 BHK Apartment at Audumber Shree Krishna CHS Borivali, Borivali East – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639161109769556204-0306260716161616.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Kitchen in 3.5 BHK Apartment at Audumber Shree Krishna CHS Borivali, Borivali East – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639161109771779018-0306260716171617.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Kitchen in 3.5 BHK Apartment at Audumber Shree Krishna CHS Borivali, Borivali East – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639161109774131737-0306260716171617.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Bedroom in 3.5 BHK Apartment at Audumber Shree Krishna CHS Borivali, Borivali East – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639161109776441364-0306260716171617.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Room in 3.5 BHK Apartment at Audumber Shree Krishna CHS Borivali, Borivali East – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639161109779112622-0306260716171617.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Bathroom in 3.5 BHK Apartment at Audumber Shree Krishna CHS Borivali, Borivali East – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639161109781654493-0306260716181618.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![3.5 BHK Apartment – Exterior View View at Audumber Shree Krishna CHS Borivali, Borivali East - for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639161109784762013-0306260716181618.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Living Room in 3.5 BHK Apartment at Audumber Shree Krishna CHS Borivali, Borivali East – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639161109787252765-0306260716181618