nts will appreciate the convenience of 1 dedicated parking space and essential amenities such as power\n\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Siddhivinayak Enclave Borivali, Borivali East](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639143049747792516-1305260936143614.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\n## 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali East, Mumbai *Location map of 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali East, Mumbai located at 19.23464, 72.86596*\n\n![Location map of 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali East, Mumbai located at 19.23464, 72.86596](/assets/images/map-icon.png)\n\n**₹ 1.5 Cr**\n\nThis unfurnished two-bedroom, two-bathroom Flats in Borivali East, Mumbai offers a practical living space within the Siddhivinayak Enclave project. Spanning 500 square feet on the 12th floor of a 15-story building, it provides a comfortable 700 square feet of living area.The property benefits from a pleasant road view and includes one dedicated car parking space, a valuable amenity in the area.Residents\n\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Maa Tulsi Vihar CHS, Borivali East](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639166282326016968-0906260657125712.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\n## 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali East, Mumbai *Location map of 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali East, Mumbai located at 19.2355903, 72.8602708*\n\n![Location map of 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali East, Mumbai located at 19.2355903, 72.8602708](/assets/images/map-icon.png)\n\n**₹ 2 Cr**\n\nExperience premium urban living in this furnished two-bedroom Flats situated in Borivali East, Mumbai, available for sale at 2 crore. This property, located on the third floor of the ten-story Maa Tulsi Vihar CHS, offers 750 square feet of well-designed space with a desirable road view.Residents will enjoy access to a range of amenities including a gymnasium, badminton court, kids` play\n\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Hirani 24K Residencies, Borivali East](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639170583747334993-1406260626142614.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\n## 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali East, Mumbai *Location map of 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali East, Mumbai located at 19.233689, 72.859272*\n\n![Location map of 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali East, Mumbai located at 19.233689, 72.859272](/assets/images/map-icon.png)\n\n**₹ 1.75 Cr**\n\nExperience city living at its finest in this 2-bedroom, semi-furnished Flats on the 17th floor of Hirani 24K Residencies in Borivali East, Mumbai. This 526 square feet home boasts a desirable road view and includes essential amenities like kids` play areas, 24 x 7 security, CCTV surveillance, car parking, and constant water supply, all within a 22-story building.Priced at 1.75 crore,\n\nPersonalized home recommendations based on your lifestyle, location, and budget.\n\n![Smarter home match recommendation preview](/assets/images/recommandation-images/recommendation-preview.png)\n![Personalized home matching](/assets/images/recommandation-images/icon-star.svg)\n\nRecommendations tailored to your real needs.\n\n![Smarter locality suggestions](/assets/images/recommandation-images/pin-icon.svg)\n\nDiscover neighborhoods that fit your lifestyle.\n\n![Budget aware recommendations](/assets/images/recommandation-images/wallet-icon.svg)\n\nFind homes that match your budget.\n\n![Personalized property recommendation cards](/assets/images/recommandation-images/property-img.png)\n![voice search]()![Bangalore city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![Chennai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![Delhi city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![Gurgaon city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![Hyderabad city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![Kolkata city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![Lucknow city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![Navi Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![Noida city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![Pune city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![Thane city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.aurumproptech.in/pulse/properties/mumbai/borivali-east/reputed-builder-shree-krishna-complex-513260","title":"Reputed Builder Shree Krishna Complex in Borivali East, Mumbai | Price, Floor Plans & Amenities","raw_content":"New Launch - India Real Estate Report 2026.\n\n[![pulse logo](/_next/image?url=%2Ffrontend%2FcommonAssets%2FPropTech_Pulse_logo.png&w=1200&q=75)](/pulse)\n\nKnowledge Hub\n\n![pulse logo](/_next/image?url=%2Ffrontend%2FcommonAssets%2FPropTech_Pulse_logo.webp&w=1200&q=75)\n\nAsk Pulse Ai\n\nServices\n\nFOR BUYERS & RENTERS\n\n[Explore verified properties across cities](/pulse/properties)[Home Loan\n\nLow-interest loans with expert support](/pulse/aurum-kuberx)[Packers & Movers\n\nReliable relocation with trusted partners](/pulse/packers-and-movers)[Interior Designing\n\nDesigns tailored to your space](/pulse/interior-design-service)\n\nFOR REAL ESTATE DEVELOPERS\n\n[Pulse 3D\n\n