lex, Borivali East — for Sale — photo 5](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded350.r2.dev/building-properties/images/builders/projects/3544_oth_12th_March_2011.jpg)\n\n![3 Shree Krishna Complex, Borivali East — for Sale — photo 6](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded350.r2.dev/building-properties/images/builders/projects/3544_oth_28th_Oct__2011.jpg)\n\n![3 Shree Krishna Complex, Borivali East — for Sale — photo 7](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded350.r2.dev/building-properties/images/builders/projects/3544_oth_7_Aug_2012.jpg)\n\n1 / 7\n\n![](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded350.r2.dev/building-properties/images/builders/projects/3544_main_thumb.webp)![](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded350.r2.dev/building-properties/images/builders/projects/3544_oth_21_Jan_2009_thumb.webp)![](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded350.r2.dev/building-properties/images/builders/projects/3544_oth_29_Oct_2009_thumb.webp)![](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded350.r2.dev/building-properties/images/builders/projects/3544_oth_12th_March_2010_thumb.webp)![](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded350.r2.dev/building-properties/images/builders/projects/3544_oth_12th_March_2011_thumb.webp)![](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded350.r2.dev/building-properties/images/builders/projects/3544_oth_28th_Oct__2011_thumb.webp)![](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded350.r2.dev/building-properties/images/builders/projects/3544_oth_7_Aug_2012_thumb.webp)\n\n## About This Property\n\nBorivali East: a 3 BHK home at Shree Krishna Complex. It measures 871 sq.ft.. On the market at ₹2.75 Cr. Arrange a viewing to see it for yourself.\n\n## Building Information\n\n![Shree Krishna Complex](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded350.r2.dev/building-properties/images/builders/projects/3544_main_thumb.webp)\n\nShree Krishna Complex\n\nBorivali East, Bld No1, C Wing Nr, Omkaresh Mandir. Opp. National Park W.E.Highway.\n\n13 floors\n\n## EMI Calculator\n\nEst. EMI: 